{"id":"talento","lemma":"talento","pos":"noun","rank":1282,"glosses":["talent"],"ipa":"/taˈlento/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"talentos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-talento.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Tienes tanto talento!","en":"You're so talented.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449606","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"copy"},null]},{"text":"Tom tiene talento como actor.","en":"Tom has a talent for acting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/296574","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"as"},{"g":"actor"}]},{"text":"Él hace buen uso de sus talentos.","en":"He makes good use of his talents.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,{"g":"use"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]},{"text":"Le falta talento para ser actor.","en":"He lacks the talent to be an actor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594298","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"lack, shortage"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"actor"}]},{"text":"Con tu talento, deberías ser capaz de conseguir mucho dinero.","en":"With your talent, you should be able to make a lot of money.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692329","words":[{"g":"with"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"maybe, perhaps"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to achieve"},{"g":"much"},{"g":"money"}]}]}